  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 1873,
      "text": "He said, “These are my daughters [to marry], if you must[33].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 71,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 222,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1874,
      "text": "By your life [O prophet], they were wandering blindly in their intoxication [of lust][34].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 72,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 222,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1875,
      "text": "So they were seized by the blast at sunrise,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 73,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 222,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1876,
      "text": "and We turned their cities upside down[35] and rained down on them stones of baked clay.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 74,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 222,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1877,
      "text": "Indeed, there are signs in this for those who discern[36].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 75,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 222,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1878,
      "text": "And their place is located by a known route[37].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 76,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 222,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1879,
      "text": "Indeed, there are signs in this for the believers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 77,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 222,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1880,
      "text": "And the people of the Forest[38] were wrongdoers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 78,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 222,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1881,
      "text": "So We punished them in retribution, and both [places][39] are by a clear highway.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 79,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 222,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1882,
      "text": "Surely the people of Al-Hijr[40] also rejected the messengers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 80,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1883,
      "text": "We gave them Our signs, but they kept turning away from them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 81,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1884,
      "text": "They carved houses in the mountains, feeling secure[41].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 82,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1885,
      "text": "So they were seized by the blast early in the morning.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 83,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1886,
      "text": "Nothing of what they earned was of any avail to them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 84,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1887,
      "text": "We have not created the heavens and earth and all that is between them except for a true purpose. The Hour is certainly coming, so bear with them graciously[42].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 85,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1888,
      "text": "Indeed, your Lord is the Absolute Creator, the All-Knowing.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 86,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1889,
      "text": "We have surely given you the seven oft-repeated verses[43] and the great Qur’an.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 87,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1890,
      "text": "Do not look longingly at the pleasures We have given certain classes[44] of them[45], nor grieve over them[46], but lower your wing [in humility] to the believers[47].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 88,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1891,
      "text": "And say, “I am indeed a clear warner.” –",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 89,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1892,
      "text": "just as We sent down [punishment] upon those who divided [their religion][48],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
